::AfterSupplyChainCh4 
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@trigger
@once 

{@Player}    That Kalvis Festival does sound fun...
{@PAL}       Another "holiday." Kalvis has had quite a few production delays lately. Unreliable.
{@Player}    Yeah... but we both know it wasn't a festival that caused the others.
{@Player}    ...Sounds fun though.
